        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Scientists have found something very special. Some people do not need as much sleep as others. This is because of their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "genes",
            "zh": "基因"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Genes are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tiny",
            "ref": "v-tiny"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " parts of DNA inside our bodies. DNA gives the body "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "instructions",
            "zh": "指令"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on how to grow, look, and work."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "People with this special gene are called natural short sleepers (NSS). They usually sleep only four to six hours each night. When they wake up, they feel happy and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ready",
            "ref": "v-ready"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for the day. If they sleep longer, they may even feel tired."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Most "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "adults",
            "ref": "v-adult"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " need at least seven hours of sleep every night. Children need between nine and twelve hours. Sleep is very important for everyone. When we sleep, our brains "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sort out",
            "zh": "梳理"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " what we learned, fix "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "memories",
            "ref": "v-memory"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and help our bodies rest and grow."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But NSS can do all these things faster. Scientist Ying-Hui Fu says their brains “work at a higher level”. They show that every person’s body is different in "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "amazing",
            "ref": "v-amazing"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " ways."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
